# ---- Privacy rules (see AGENTS.md > Privacy rules and docs/PRIVACY_SAFEGUARDS.md) ----
# Internal verification, review, log and evidence data never enters the public repository.
# Patterns, so new files of these kinds are excluded without editing this list.
# If you introduce a new kind of internal file, add a pattern here AND to FORBIDDEN_PATHS in scripts/privacy-guard.mjs.
Data/**/*review*.csv
Data/**/*review*.json
Data/**/*review*.md
Data/**/*evidence*.csv
Data/**/*evidence*.json
Data/**/*verification*.csv
Data/**/*verification*.json
Data/**/*verification*.md
Data/**/*change_log*
Data/**/*observation*.csv
Data/**/*unresolved*
Data/**/*followup*
Data/**/*worklist*
Data/**/*rejected*
Data/**/*overlapping*
Data/**/*search_log*
Data/**/*search_attempts*
Data/**/*checkpoint*
Data/**/*candidates*
Data/**/*excluded*
Data/**/*removal*
Data/**/*removed*
Data/_research_reviews/
Data/_archive/
Data/_exports/
Data/User updates/
**/private/
.env*
